<title>UK: Partco to seek permission to buy own shares.</title>
<headline>Partco to seek permission to buy own shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Partco Group Plc said on Thursday it will ask shareholders at its annual meeting on May 14 for authorisation to purchase its own shares.</p>
<p>Shares in the automotive components manufacturer were up 16 pence at 325.5 pence by 1554 GMT.</p>
